yamnet-v1.bin is YAMNet, a model by Google, converted from the file MediaPipe publishes
(https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/audio_classifier/yamnet/float32/1/yamnet.tflite)
by tools/sound-spike/export_yamnet.py: the same weights, re-arranged and kept as int8 with a scale
per channel. YAMNet is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). It was trained on AudioSet
(https://research.google.com/audioset/). The conversion changed the file format only.
